{"change_summary":"Updated the habitat-geometry probe suite so the biofilter-scaling probe now matches its actual large-media scenario and validates reduced-nitrogen clearance plus end-of-run nitrifier biomass, while the substrate-redox probe now uses live rooted plants with equal decomposer loading, a thinner inert control, and explicit denitrifier maturation/decay checks instead of a pre-seeded mature state.","outstanding_risks":["Validation was limited to `crates/tank_harness/tests/e2e_habitat_geometry_probes.rs`; I did not rerun the broader `tank_harness` or workspace test suites.","The worktree already contained unrelated modifications outside this test file (`crates/tank_harness/src/lib.rs`, `.claude/worktrees/...`, `.ralph-burning/`); I left them untouched and did not validate their impact here."],"steps":[{"description":"Inspect the pending habitat-geometry probe amendments and compare them against the current biofilter and substrate-redox implementations.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Patch `crates/tank_harness/tests/e2e_habitat_geometry_probes.rs` so the biofilter probe checks the documented behavior and the redox probe uses live rooted plants, matched decomposer loading, and denitrifier maturation/decay assertions.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Format the workspace and run targeted validation for the updated habitat-geometry probe file.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`cargo fmt --all`","`cargo test -p tank_harness --test e2e_habitat_geometry_probes probe_biofilter_scaling_bigger_media_faster_cycling -- --nocapture`","`cargo test -p tank_harness --test e2e_habitat_geometry_probes probe_substrate_redox_denitrification -- --nocapture`","`cargo test -p tank_harness --test e2e_habitat_geometry_probes -- --nocapture`"]}